Supported commands:

`!help`
Show this command list.

`!status`
List watched players and their recorded best parses for the latest Savage tier plus any Ultimates they have done.

`!subscribe`
Receive parse improvement DMs.

`!unsubscribe`
Stop receiving parse improvement DMs.

`!watch <name> <server> <region>`
Start tracking a player.

`!unwatch <name> <server> <region>`
Stop tracking a player.
